  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Clean Minimalism\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Clean Minimalism\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\\\"es\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\"><style>:root{--bg-navy:#1A1A2E;--bg-navy-med:#16213E;--bg-light:#F8F9FA;--coral:#E94560;--text-white:#FFFFFF;--text-dark:#1A1A2E;--text-muted:#6B7280;--success:#22C55E;--warning:#F59E0B}*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:\'Inter\',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}body,html{height:768px;width:1024px;overflow:hidden;background-color:var(--bg-light)}.container{display:flex;height:100%;width:100%}.sidebar{width:220px;background:var(--bg-navy);color:var(--text-white);display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex-shrink:0}.logo-area{padding:30px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.logo-v{color:var(--coral);font-weight:900;font-size:28px}.logo-text{color:var(--text-white);font-weight:700;font-size:24px}.nav-menu{flex:1}.nav-item{padding:14px 20px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:14px;transition:all .2s;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}.nav-item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--text-white)}.nav-item.active{background:var(--coral);color:var(--text-white);font-weight:600}.main-content{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}.top-header{height:60px;background:var(--bg-navy);border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 30px;color:var(--text-white)}.view-container{padding:25px;flex:1;display:none}.view-container.active{display:block}.kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;margin-bottom:25px}.kpi-card{background:var(--bg-navy-med);padding:20px;border-radius:4px;color:var(--text-white);box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.kpi-label{font-size:12px;opacity:.7;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:8px}.kpi-value{font-size:24px;font-weight:700}.alert-bar{background:#fff;border-left:4px solid var(--coral);padding:15px 20px;margin-bottom:25px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}.table-card{background:#fff;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1);overflow:hidden}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}th{background:var(--bg-light);text-align:left;padding:12px 20px;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-muted);border-bottom:1px solid #eee}td{padding:14px 20px;font-size:13px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;color:var(--text-dark)}.badge{padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase}.badge-success{background:rgba(34,197,94,.1);color:var(--success)}.badge-warning{background:rgba(245,158,11,.1);color:var(--warning)}.badge-coral{background:var(--coral);color:white}.btn{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;border:none;transition:opacity .2s}.btn-primary{background:var(--coral);color:white}.btn-secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--bg-navy);color:var(--bg-navy)}.login-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:var(--bg-navy);z-index:100;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, rgba(233,69,96,0.1) 1px, transparent 0);background-size:24px 24px}.login-box{width:400px;background:white;padding:40px;border-radius:4px;text-align:center}.login-box .logo-area{justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px}.login-box p{color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:30px;font-size:14px}.input-group{text-align:left;margin-bottom:20px}.input-group label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--text-dark)}.input-group input{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:4px;outline:none}.input-group input:focus{border-color:var(--coral)}.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px}.quote-preview{border-left:1px solid #eee;padding-left:20px}</style></head><body><div id=\\\"loginView\\\" class=\\\"login-overlay\\\"><div class=\\\"login-box\\\"><div class=\\\"logo-area\\\"><span class=\\\"logo-v\\\">V</span><span class=\\\"logo-text\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--bg-navy)\\\">ermur</span></div><p>El eslab\303\263n log\303\255stico de tu cadena de valor</p><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>CORREO ELECTR\303\223NICO</label><input type=\\\"email\\\" value=\\\"operaciones@vermur.com\\\"></div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>CONTRASE\303\221A</label><input type=\\\"password\\\" value=\\\"\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\\\"></div><button onclick=\\\"doLogin()\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;padding:14px\\\">INGRESAR</button></div></div><div class=\\\"container\\\"><div class=\\\"sidebar\\\"><div class=\\\"logo-area\\\"><span class=\\\"logo-v\\\">V</span><span class=\\\"logo-text\\\">ermur</span></div><div class=\\\"nav-menu\\\"><div class=\\\"nav-item active\\\" onclick=\\\"view(\'dash\')\\\">Dashboard</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\" onclick=\\\"view(\'quotes\')\\\">Cotizaciones</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\" onclick=\\\"view(\'ship\')\\\">Embarques</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\" onclick=\\\"view(\'clients\')\\\">Clientes</div><div class=\\\"nav-item\\\">Reportes</div></div><div style=\\\"padding:20px;font-size:11px;opacity:.5\\\">VermurOps v2.4</div></div><div class=\\\"main-content\\\"><div class=\\\"top-header\\\"><div><span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:18px\\\">Dashboard Principal</span></div><div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;font-size:13px\\\"><span>Admin Vermur</span><button onclick=\\\"location.reload()\\\" style=\\\"background:none;border:none;color:white;cursor:pointer;opacity:.7\\\">Cerrar Sesi\303\263n</button></div></div><div id=\\\"view-dash\\\" class=\\\"view-container active\\\"><div class=\\\"kpi-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"kpi-card\\\"><div class=\\\"kpi-label\\\">Embarques Activos</div><div class=\\\"kpi-value\\\">24</div></div><div class=\\\"kpi-card\\\"><div class=\\\"kpi-label\\\">Cotizaciones Pend.</div><div class=\\\"kpi-value\\\">12</div></div><div class=\\\"kpi-card\\\"><div class=\\\"kpi-label\\\">Clientes Activos</div><div class=\\\"kpi-value\\\">86</div></div><div class=\\\"kpi-card\\\"><div class=\\\"kpi-label\\\">Ingresos Mes (USD)</div><div class=\\\"kpi-value\\\">$142,500</div></div></div><div class=\\\"alert-bar\\\"><div><strong style=\\\"color:var(--coral)\\\">ALERTA OPERATIVA:</strong> 3 embarques requieren documentaci\303\263n de pedimento inmediata.</div><button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Revisar</button></div><div class=\\\"table-card\\\"><table><thead><tr><th># Embarque</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Origen / Destino</th><th>Estatus</th><th>ETA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>MX-2024-001</td><td>Grupo Textil Monterrey</td><td>Shanghai \342\206\222 Manzanillo</td><td><span class=\\\"badge\\\" style=\\\"background:#dcfce7;color:#166534\\\">En Tr\303\241nsito</span></td><td>15 Oct 2024</td></tr><tr><td>MX-2024-002</td><td>Industrias Quer\303\251taro SA</td><td>Veracruz \342\206\222 Rotterdam</td><td><span class=\\\"badge badge-warning\\\">Aduana</span></td><td>12 Oct 2024</td></tr><tr><td>MX-2024-003</td><td>Comercial del Norte</td><td>Laredo \342\206\222 Monterrey</td><td><span class=\\\"badge\\\" style=\\\"background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e\\\">Documentaci\303\263n</span></td><td>Ma\303\261ana</td></tr><tr><td>MX-2024-004</td><td>Grupo Textil Monterrey</td><td>Ningbo \342\206\222 Manzanillo</td><td><span class=\\\"badge\\\" style=\\\"background:#e0e7ff;color:#3730a3\\\">Confirmado</span></td><td>22 Oct 2024</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div id=\\\"view-quotes\\\" class=\\\"view-container\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:30px\\\"><div style=\\\"flex:1.5\\\"><h3 style=\\\"margin-bottom:20px\\\">Nueva Cotizaci\303\263n</h3><div class=\\\"form-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>CLIENTE</label><select style=\\\"width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #ddd\\\"><option>Industrias Quer\303\251taro SA</option></select></div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>TIPO</label><select style=\\\"width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #ddd\\\"><option>\360\237\232\242 Mar\303\255timo</option></select></div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>ORIGEN</label><input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"Shanghai (CNSHA)\\\"></div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>DESTINO</label><input type=\\\"text\\\" value=\\\"Manzanillo (MXZLO)\\\"></div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>PESO (KG)</label><input type=\\\"number\\\" value=\\\"12500\\\"></div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>VOLUMEN (M3)</label><input type=\\\"number\\\" value=\\\"24\\\"></div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>INCOTERM</label><select style=\\\"width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #ddd\\\"><option>CIF</option><option>FOB</option></select></div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><label>NOTAS</label><input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Carga general\\\"></div></div></div><div style=\\\"flex:1;background:white;padding:20px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #eee\\\"><h4>Tarifas Disponibles</h4><div style=\\\"margin:20px 0\\\"><div style=\\\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\"><span>Hapag-Lloyd</span><strong>$2,450 USD</strong></div><div style=\\\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\"><span>MSC</span><strong>$2,380 USD</strong></div><div style=\\\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\"><span>CMA CGM</span><strong>$2,510 USD</strong></div></div><button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" style=\\\"width:100%\\\">GENERAR COTIZACI\303\223N PDF</button></div></div></div></div></div><script>function doLogin(){document.getElementById(\'loginView\').style.display=\'none\'}function view(v){document.querySelectorAll(\'.view-container\').forEach(el=>el.classList.remove(\'active\'));document.getElementById(\'view-\'+v).classList.add(\'active\');document.querySelectorAll(\'.nav-item\').forEach(el=>el.classList.remove(\'active\'));event.target.classList.add(\'active\');document.querySelector(\'.top-header span\').innerText=event.target.innerText}</script></body></html>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
