  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing CRM Tabs**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the \"Clientes\" module\'s expansion. I\'ve designed horizontal tabs for \"Cuentas,\" \"Contactos,\" \"Leads,\" and \"Oportunidades,\" with \"Cuentas\" being active initially. A search bar is implemented to allow searching by company name, tax ID, or contact information.\n\n\n**Defining Client Cards**\n\nI\'ve added \"Nuevo cliente\" and \"Importar CSV\" buttons. The \"Cuentas\" view is taking shape as a refined grid of cards, with each card displaying company details like name, RFC, contact info, and mini-metrics for shipments, quotes, and balance. A \"Ver ficha\" button sits at the card\'s base. Each card has key data and visual indicators, like a \"vencido\" (overdue) status. The \"Ficha de cliente\" design includes a header and internal tabs for detailed information.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 884249687
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
