  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding the \"Bookings\" Screen**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing the \"Bookings\" screen, which acts as the intermediary between the accepted quote (\"Cotizaci\303\263n aceptada\") and the final \"Embarque\" stage. My immediate tasks are to update the `Sidebar.tsx` file to incorporate the \"Reservas\" option and then to integrate the `Bookings` component into the `App.tsx` structure.\n\n\n**Developing the Bookings Feature**\n\nI\'m making swift progress on the Bookings feature. I\'ve laid the groundwork for the `Bookings.tsx` file, implementing both a main table view and a detailed view, as well as a form for new bookings. Right now, I\'m working with static data to represent initial bookings within the system. The next step is to integrate the data structure I defined for the bookings into my table.\n\n\n"
