    thinking: "**Designing the Exchange Rate Screen**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing an \"Tipo de cambio\" (Exchange Rate) screen, as requested. The plan involves making it multi-currency, specifically tailored to the Mexican context and integrating DOF/Banxico data. I\'ve started sketching out the initial UI elements, including a header with \"Tipo de cambio\" and KPI-style top cards displaying USD/MXN and EUR/MX rates.\n\n\n**Developing the New Features**\n\nI\'m now expanding the Exchange Rate screen to incorporate more currencies, like CNY/MXN. I\'m focusing on \"Tipo de cambio del d\303\255a (para CFDI)\" to handle official DOF rates, along with auto-update functionality. There is a need to create a history table and a quick conversion calculator. I\'ve started the structure by creating `ExchangeRates.tsx` which will include all the state to be able to show all that. The next steps will be including this new page in the app, routing the page and adding to the Sidebar.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
